<section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/tx9h2sbct7zN6xGWGJcF3gSujiaSpoSYWicAvV9jXc0f0AKhNeNqHtyQZDZBHxPJAS9Ku79AYpsxFIibjK19n8btSFOcfBfu4MAVKrh2SGVktE/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>五、申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/tx9h2sbct7zN6xGWGJcF3gSujiaSpoSYWicAvV9jXc0f0AKhNeNqHtyQZDZBHxPJAS9Ku79AYpsxFIibjK19n8btSFOcfBfu4MAVKrh2SGVktE/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1. 有效期内的学生证、身份证复印件（复试时出示原件）；</span></p><p><span>2. 加盖所在学校教务处公章的本科成绩单一份；</span></p><p><span>3. 推荐免试攻读研究生个人陈述1份（格式不限，3000字以内）；</span></p><p><span>4. 外语水平证明复印件1份（国家英语四、六级考试成绩，或TOEFL、IELTS、GRE成绩等）；</span></p><p><span>5. 获奖证书复印件一份；</span></p><p><span>6. 其他体现学术水平的代表性学术论文、出版物、专利证书或具有学术水平工作成果的复印件或证明；</span></p><p><span>7. 《北京理工大学2027年招收优秀应届本科毕业生直接攻读博士学位研究生专家推荐书》一式两份（请从北理工研究生院官网下载，推荐人须是2名副教授或相当职称以上专家，推荐书须由推荐人密封并在封口处签字）。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>所有材料均需使用A4纸，申请人的全部申请材料均在复试时提交学院审核备案，提交的材料恕不退还。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/tx9h2sbct7zN6xGWGJcF3gSujiaSpoSYWicAvV9jXc0f0AKhNeNqHtyQZDZBHxPJAS9Ku79AYpsxFIibjK19n8btSFOcfBfu4MAVKrh2SGVktE/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>六、材料提交方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/tx9h2sbct7zN6xGWGJcF3gSujiaSpoSYWicAvV9jXc0f0AKhNeNqHtyQZDZBHxPJAS9Ku79AYpsxFIibjK19n8btSFOcfBfu4MAVKrh2SGVktE/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>电子版材料：</span></strong><span><strong><span>请于9月10日下午17:00前将除专家推荐信外的上述申请材料按照以上顺序合并成一个PDF发送至邮箱cibrstudent-apply@cibr.ac.cn，命名为“姓名+2027北理工预推免报名材料”</span></strong></span><span>；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>专家推荐信：</span></strong><span>请推荐专家在9月10日17：00前以推荐老师本人的邮箱（</span><strong><span>必须为老师官网公布的邮箱</span></strong><span>）将推荐信亲笔签名，扫描后发送至邮箱cibrstudent-apply@cibr.ac.cn。邮件和附件题目请以“2027北京理工大学-北京脑所推荐信-被推荐学生的姓名”命名；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>纸质版材料：</span></strong><span>申请人将填好的全部申请材料（统一使用A4纸，按顺序用长尾夹左侧夹好，请勿用订书器装订）装入自备的信封，信封正面请注明“XX（学生姓名）推荐免试申请资料”。在复试时提交考核组，提交的材料恕不退还。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/tx9h2sbct7zN6xGWGJcF3gSujiaSpoSYWicAvV9jXc0f0AKhNeNqHtyQZDZBHxPJAS9Ku79AYpsxFIibjK19n8btSFOcfBfu4MAVKrh2SGVktE/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>七、录取工作</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/tx9h2sbct7zN6xGWGJcF3gSujiaSpoSYWicAvV9jXc0f0AKhNeNqHtyQZDZBHxPJAS9Ku79AYpsxFIibjK19n8btSFOcfBfu4MAVKrh2SGVktE/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>接收推荐免试研究生拟录取名单将根据考生综合复试成绩排名和学科方向招生名额综合统筹确定，考核组秘书将在2026年9月20日20：00前通知考生复试结果。复试通过的申请人应按照教育部规定登录“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”（以下简称“推免服务系统”，https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm）进行网上报名。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>9月21日9:00后，学生可以进行报名，9月22日9:00后，招生单位向考生发送复试通知，学生可以确认复试通知。9月24日8:00后，招生单位向学生发送待录取通知，9月24日14:00后，学生可以确认待录取通知。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>考生须网上确认“同意待录取”才能完成录取过程，未在规定时间内确认“同意待录取”的，视为自动放弃待录取资格，将不再保留其拟录取资格，学院将依据复试排名递补录取。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>有下列情况之一者，将由北京理工大学取消其录取资格：</span></strong></p><p><span>1.思想政治品德考核未通过；</span></p><p><span>2.提供的材料、个人信息与事实不符，存在舞弊现象；</span></p><p><span>3.录取当年未获得本科毕业证书；</span></p><p><span>4.不符合规定的体检标准或因身体缺陷、疾病而不能继续学习。</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/tx9h2sbct7zN6xGWGJcF3gSujiaSpoSYWicAvV9jXc0f0AKhNeNqHtyQZDZBHxPJAS9Ku79AYpsxFIibjK19n8btSFOcfBfu4MAVKrh2SGVktE/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>八、培养方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/tx9h2sbct7zN6xGWGJcF3gSujiaSpoSYWicAvV9jXc0f0AKhNeNqHtyQZDZBHxPJAS9Ku79AYpsxFIibjK19n8btSFOcfBfu4MAVKrh2SGVktE/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>录取学生第一学年在北京理工大学完成基础课的同时进入所内实验室开展轮转，博士生需进行3轮轮转，每轮时间为2个月。轮转结束后，导师和学生进行双向选择，确定研究方向，报名时不需要选导师，各实验室的详细信息请见北京脑所官网-人才培养-导师介绍的相关内容：</span></p><p><span>https://cibr.ac.cn/cibrPersonnel/admissions</span></p><p><span><span>或扫描二维码访问</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/tx9h2sbct7wskxNlGkjwyj80Ht4ekMSe001P5nWGDGRWUguU2Hc9TQVf5tGx8bBeStibiaAayDS2HmY55xMh9kKSKhIg0JySE4sjKDIZBOpKc/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/tx9h2sbct7zN6xGWGJcF3gSujiaSpoSYWicAvV9jXc0f0AKhNeNqHtyQZDZBHxPJAS9Ku79AYpsxFIibjK19n8btSFOcfBfu4MAVKrh2SGVktE/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>九、联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/tx9h2sbct7zN6xGWGJcF3gSujiaSpoSYWicAvV9jXc0f0AKhNeNqHtyQZDZBHxPJAS9Ku79AYpsxFIibjK19n8btSFOcfBfu4MAVKrh2SGVktE/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><ul><li><p><strong><span>联系人：</span></strong><span>杨老师</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><span>办公地址：</span></span></strong><span><span>北京市昌平区中关村生命科学园医科路9号院3号楼B123办公室</span></span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><span>咨询电话：</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>010-81912671</span></span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><span>电子邮件：</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>cibrstudent-apply@cibr.ac.cn</span></span></p></li><li><p><strong><span><span>邮政编码：</span></span></strong><span><span>102206</span></span></p></li></ul></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/tx9h2sbct7yN0iaPicq25cBgmGxZiajOuxXjoyTkTdDic7s0F7P8OgsqwSE6vicMntUw61JOIEkdNhJkpCxk92casf2WrEjrvZQu9UmkuNrOWNeU/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"7038df6fbb0b12186f0c7267901690cfeeae065334b8b83ffbe98c2e0521b220","textLength":1953,"sourceSha256":"4561f083618398190a141de9e4f1edeafb1d256f2c1b6ce7474acb24095ec775","selector":"#js_content","at